# 64 mW molecules. A restraint pulls the smooth ice fraction toward 0.4.
units real
atom_style atomic
boundary p p p
read_data data.ice
mass 1 18.0154
pair_style sw
pair_coeff * * mW.sw mW
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
timestep 5.0
velocity all create 220.0 7 dist gaussian
fix pl all plumed plumedfile plumed.dat outfile plumed.out
fix nve all nve
thermo 20
run 40
